  - elementId: right-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 132, 264, 220]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12.5
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>企业主流部署</strong>：知识库部署在远端平台，团队共享同一份知识库。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>问题</strong>：查询时需到远端拉取知识库内容，拼接上下文耗时。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>思路</strong>：把 Flink 的状态能力用于多轮会话 / 跨会话的知识库缓存，缓存最近最常访问的知识资料。</p>

  - elementId: takeaway-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 442, 3, 42]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 442, 832, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 13.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        知识库缓存 = 多轮 / 跨会话复用的第二类形态；Flink 算子状态是它的天然载体，也是本课题「语义记忆」的落点。

  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 512, 600, 13]
    content:
